1a:T592,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is TUM tuition-free for every international student?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Non-EU/EEA tuition applies to many newly enrolled bachelor’s and master’s students, with exceptions. Check the exact programme, intake and personal category."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does a TUM scholarship automatically cover tuition and living costs?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. A waiver and a cash grant have different purposes. Confirm the amount, coverage and duration in the specific award terms."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does requesting a VPD apply me to TUM?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The university also requires the relevant programme application in TUMonline. Follow its VPD and portal instructions as separate tasks."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the universal TUM GPA or IELTS requirement?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is no single figure that should be applied to every programme. Use the academic, assessment and language requirements of the exact degree."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are tuition rates changing for 2027?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The checked official tuition page announces higher bands from winter semester 2027/28. Confirm the current course-specific amount before setting your budget."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"$undefined","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/technical-university-of-munich-admissions-scholarships/\",\"name\":\"Technical University of Munich: admission, tuition and scholarship planning\",\"description\":\"Plan a TUM application with programme requirements, the separate VPD step, non-EU tuition, waivers and realistic scholarship funding checks.